Z||000000||sqoach||09-16-2001||12:53 AM||||I've been considering doing a molding swap on my 86 SE. But I've been wondering how the rear fascia will line up. I know the notchback fascia is at an angle. Does the fastback fascia angle, or is it more straight up and down. Anyone know what I'm talking about?<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">         <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC (FOR SALE)</FONT>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Sootah||09-16-2001||01:09 AM||||Fastback is straight up and down, just look at the white GT up at the top of the forums page. What I want to know, is if you put the facia on, do you have to swap decklids as well? Don't mind the notchback, I actually like it, but I don't like the angled taillights (I'm really picky about what makes a Fiero look good, I think the '84s look like trucks from the side)<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">   <BR><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I> <BR><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter||||reg||1
Z||000002||Galen||09-16-2001||01:21 AM||||You're thinking of the clip itself.. the fascia should be the same.. ? I dunno, never paid attention to em<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/g-flag-sig.gif"> <FONT COLOR="purple">1988 Hawaiin Orchid Coupe</FONT> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/g-flagnc-sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Wolfhound||09-16-2001||06:26 AM||||If you mean the facia, Yes it lines up fine.<BR>There are slight differences. No embossed pontiac and the facia is slightly longer front to rear so the sub bumper may need replacing also for a tight fit.||||reg||1
Z||000004||sqoach||09-16-2001||02:59 PM||||Yeah, I looked at the white one up there, that's why I was curious. Anyone actually done this? I know someone has.||||reg||1
